SWITCHLESS-NCCL-RING-4-GB10
Copyright 2026 Friso van Dort

This repository contains a patch to NVIDIA NCCL (https://github.com/NVIDIA/nccl),
which is distributed under NVIDIA's NCCL licence.

The patch builds on the switchless-nccl patches published by Alex Ellis,
OpenFaaS Ltd (https://github.com/alexellis/switchless-nccl), which in turn
build on the switchless patches published by SparkRing
(https://github.com/FujitsuPolycom/sparkring). Those patches are Apache-2.0 and
are not included in this repository.
